<div class="container">
    <div class="page_title2">
        <div class="container">
            <h3><strong>Celebrating Pakistani Researchers Among the World&#39;s Top 2% Scientists</strong></h3>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="newsdescription">
        <p>Dr. Ali Javed (Associate Professor) and Dr. Marriam Nawaz (Lecturer) from the Department of Software Engineering at the University of Engineering and Technology Taxila were honored with certificates of recognition by the Chairman of the Higher Education Commission (HEC) Pakistan, Niaz Ahmad Akhtar, during the ceremony titled <strong>“Celebrating Pakistani Researchers Among the World’s Top 2% Scientists.”</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Both faculty members have been included for <strong>two consecutive years</strong> in the prestigious <strong>World’s Top 2% Scientists list</strong> compiled by Stanford University, USA, recognizing their impactful research contributions at the global level.</p>
        <br />
    </div>
    <div>
        <ul class="eventdetailsulimages">
                            <li class="col-md-3 col-sm-6 col-xs-12 clearClass">
                                <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="/images/MainNewsData/3759//images/001.jpg"><img class="img-responsive nopadding" src="/images/MainNewsData/3759//images/001.jpg" alt="001.jpg"></a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="col-md-3 col-sm-6 col-xs-12 ">
                                <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="/images/MainNewsData/3759//images/002.jpg"><img class="img-responsive nopadding" src="/images/MainNewsData/3759//images/002.jpg" alt="002.jpg"></a>
                            </li>

        </ul>
    </div>
    <p>&nbsp;</p> 
</div>


